# Visual baselines are Linux-only (apps/storybook/tests/visual.spec.ts); a Mac run writes these
apps/storybook/tests/visual.spec.ts-snapshots/*-darwin.png
apps/storybook/tests/visual.spec.ts-snapshots/*-win32.png

# Design prototypes are local scratch work, never committed
docs/prototypes/
